<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00464">
	<title>Emergency braking</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03519">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03520">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV055144L.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e03521"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e03522">
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Emergency braking</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Emergency braking will alert the driver with a forward safety warning light blinking (<image align="left" height="0.117in" href="../../images/WKIA_037.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" width="0.143in" scale="15" id="e03523"/>), a warning message, steering wheel vibration and an audible warning.</p>
		<p outputclass="across">Emergency braking will be activated in following conditions.</p>
		<ul id="e03524">
			<li>
				<p>Your driving speed: Approximately 30–130 km/h (19–80 mph)</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Oncoming vehicle or powered two-wheeler speed: Approximately above 10 km/h (6 mph)</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>When the target enters the operating area of the function.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>